 * 📏️S-8 rule 2 (`POLICY_GRAMMAR_HONESTY`): flags a grammar leaf (`.g4`/`.ebnf`/`.grammar.semio` under
 * `📝️text/`, `.ksy`/`.spicy`/`.abnf`/`.protocol.semio` under `💾️binary/`) whose content is still the
